 srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Portrait_Velki.png/30px-Portrait_Velki.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Portrait_Velki.png/45px-Portrait_Velki.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Portrait_Velki.png/60px-Portrait_Velki.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Velki\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Portrait_Velki.png/30px-Portrait_Velki.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Portrait_Velki.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Velki\" title=\"Velki\">Velki</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Viconia_DeVir\" title=\"Viconia DeVir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png/30px-Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png/45px-Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png/60px-Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Viconia DeVir\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png/30px-Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cd/Portrait_Viconia_DeVir.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Viconia_DeVir\" title=\"Viconia DeVir\">Viconia DeVir</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zerillis\" title=\"Zerillis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Zerillis.png/30px-Portrait_Zerillis.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Zerillis.png/45px-Portrait_Zerillis.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Zerillis.png/60px-Portrait_Zerillis.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zerillis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Zerillis.png/30px-Portrait_Zerillis.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Portrait_Zerillis.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zerillis\" title=\"Zerillis\">Zerillis</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>SANCTUARY</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Sanctuary\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Sanctuary (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Sanctuary</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity can't be targeted by enemy attacks or spells. However, it can still take damage from spells that influence a larger area. Condition ends if the affected entity attacks or harms another creature, and will receive <a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary_Blocked_(Condition)\" title=\"Sanctuary Blocked (Condition)\">Sanctuary Blocked</a> for 1 turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Sanctuary_of_Loss\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary_of_Loss_(Condition)\" title=\"Sanctuary of Loss (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary of Loss\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary_of_Loss_(Condition)\" title=\"Sanctuary of Loss (Condition)\">Sanctuary of Loss</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The Nightbringer's dark arcana stops this entity being directly targeted by spells or attacks until it takes a harmful action.</li>\n<li>Areas of effect can still harm this entity.</li>\n<li>Viconia can still use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heartwrench\" title=\"Heartwrench\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heartwrench\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heartwrench\" title=\"Heartwrench\">Heartwrench</a> and keep this protection.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Spindleweb_Sanctuary\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spindleweb_Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Spindleweb Sanctuary (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spindleweb Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Spindleweb_Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Spindleweb Sanctuary (Condition)\">Spindleweb Sanctuary</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity can't be targeted by enemy attacks or spells. However, it can still take damage from spells that influence a larger area. If the affected entity attacks or harms another creature, the sanctuary will shatter, dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">3d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> to nearby creatures.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Can't be targeted by attacks or spells, ends when attacking another creature.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201706\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.155 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.162 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9942/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 146589/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 40650/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 23/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.